flowchart TD
  Push([Git push]) --> Lint[Run linter]
  Lint --> Tests{Tests pass?}
  Tests -->|yes| Build[Build artifact]
  Build --> Deploy{Deploy ok?}
  Deploy -->|yes| Smoke[Smoke tests]
  Smoke --> Live([Production])
  Tests -->|no| Fail1[Notify author]
  Deploy -->|no| Rollback[Roll back release]
  Rollback --> Fail2[Page on-call]

  %% @main Push Lint Tests Build Deploy Smoke Live
  %% @exit Tests -> Fail1, Deploy -> Rollback
